# Fresh simulator storage opens the first Easy puzzle.
wait-for-id game-more
expect Sudoku · Easy 1
expect Choose a square
# Undo is first at the foot, and says so when there is nothing to undo.
tap-id game-undo
wait-idle
expect Nothing to undo yet.
tap-id cell-0
tap-id pencil
tap-id digit-2
wait-idle
expect Notes
shot sudoku-notes
tap-id game-undo
tap-id pencil
# Rules are one tap away in the top bar.
tap-id game-rules
expect Use 1–9 once
shot sudoku-help
tap Back
wait-idle
# More opens over the board: New game first, mistakes in plain words.
tap-id game-more
wait-idle
expect New game
expect Show mistakes
expect-missing Check off
shot sudoku-more
tap-id checking
# The first square of Easy 1 is a 1, so a 2 is flagged in words and kept.
tap-id cell-0
tap-id digit-2
wait-idle
expect Wrong answer
tap-id game-undo
tap-id game-more
wait-idle
expect Hide mistakes
tap-id checking
tap-id erase
wait-idle
expect This square is already empty.
# With nothing to lose, New game only asks for a difficulty, then moves on.
tap-id game-more
tap-id game-new
wait-idle
expect Choose a difficulty.
tap-id new-easy
wait-idle
expect Sudoku · Easy 2
shot sudoku-game
